0..50 Comment "//! Natural-number addition tests recursive sugar."
51..54 Comment "//!"
55..109 Comment "//! An arm can return a call result or elide `return`."
110..158 Comment "//! It can also nest a call under a constructor."
159..198 Comment "//! A field can hold an explicit `run`."
199..202 Comment "//!"
203..249 Comment "//! Each spelling evaluates to the same value."
250..292 Comment "//! A structural call uses a smaller term."
293..332 Comment "//! The list sources use related folds."
333..336 Comment "//!"
337..393 Comment "//! - cites: [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]"
394..397 Comment "//!"
